  <para style="h">2 BaThesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Gwebubili Gwa Phawuli ku Ba THESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 BaThesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 BaTh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Gwebubili gwaPhawuli ekwalila</para>
  <para style="mt1">BATHESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo gobubili gwakakwaligwa BaThesalonika gwakakwagwa naMpositoli Phawuli (2 BaThesalonika 1.1). Wakakwala lukwalo igogu mumahhuba mahomanana hule kwebakwalila BaThesalonika bekutanga. Kokumbuligwa kuti wakagukwala mumakole makumi mahanu nelin'ompela hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu. Phawuli wakakwala lukwalo igogu mumahhuba aligele kuKhorinte esumikila ikweno. Gubungano lekuBaThesalonika igubungano lakabambiwa naPhawuli alimugwendo gugwe gwebubili gwebusumikili (Mihingo 17.1-10). Lukwalo gweMihingo Yebapositoli goti laka lili gubungano laka linginiwa nemaJuta nemaGiriki manjinji.</para>
  <para style="ip">Gubungano leku Thesalonika lakafanilabe lakalida ziba kwazo nekwezwibaka zwebupelo nehha kwebubili kwaKhirisitu, ngobe Phawuli unokwala nekwako kanjinji muwhalo dzose mbili dzaaka ekwalila BaThesalonika. Tjikamu tjekutanga tjelukwalo gobubili gweBaThesalonika tjoleba nekwezwibaka zwebupelo. Phawuli wakatjemela banhu nekwebusimbe. Wakabalaya kuti nhu wose unofanila hingila zodliwa zwaanodla. (2 BaThesalonika 3.6-10).</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unotanga kwala lukwalo igogu ngezwitula kuti iye ndiye yani nebamwe baanohinga nabo (BaThesalonika 1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unoboka Ndzimu nekwegubungano limu Thesalonika kakale elitembezelela (2 BaThesalonika 1.3-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mudanho lebubili Phawuli unoleba nekwezwibaka zwemahhuba ebupelo</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotjemela nekwebusimbe elakidza patjena kuti kwakafanila kuti kuhingiwe (2 BaThesalonika 3.1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unopeta nebuyisa gubungano kakale (2 BaThesalonika 3.16-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Kubva kuna Phawuli naSilivenasi naThimothi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Kugubungano lebagalimoyo likuThesalonika laNdzimu Tate bedu naHe Yesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Ngoni nekunyalala kunobva kunaNdzimu Tate bedu naHe Yesu Khirisitu ngakube kumuli.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tongwa Kunowhoyetika Pakubuya KwaKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Takafanila boka Ndzimu lubaka gose nekwenyu makamu, sekwakafanila, ngobe bugalimoyo gwenyu gokula kwazo kwazo, neludo gwamunago kuwumwe newumwe gowanda. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ndizo ke iswi tozwiloba fuba nekwenyu mumakubungano eNdzimu, nentha yewhilidzila kwenyu nebugalimoyo gwenyu mukudziyidziwa kwenyu nemanikanyiwa kwenyu kwamunosimidzila muli mukuli.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ikoku busupi gupatjena gwetonga kweNdzimu kwakalulama, kuyetila kuti mukobagwa sebakafanila bumambo gweNdzimu, gunoba igo kakale gwamunodziyilila. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Ndzimu wakalulama. unowhobgwilizila nemagwadzo kuna ibabo banomugwadzisa <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />nemupa nyaluluka imwi munodziyidziwa, netipa bo nyaluluka iswi. Ipapo He Yesu paanowhozumbunugwa ebva kudzimu enabatumwa babe banamasimba kwazo alimumoto unopfuta, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />ebgwilizila nelanga ibabo basingazibe Ndzimu, basingawhilile ndebo mbuya yaHe wedu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Banowhopiwa langiwa kwepaladziwa kusingapele nethubukanyiwa nebuyapo gwaHe kose negudzo lemasimba awe, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />muna ilelo hhuba laanowhohha ewhokudziwa mubayengemali babe, netjenamiwa nabo bose bakagalamoyo, ngobe busupi gwedu gwatakaleba kumuli gwakagagwamoyo.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Nentha yayikoku togala timutembezelela, kuti Ndzimu wedu amuthame mube bakafanila dana kukwe, kakale kuti ngemasimba awe ahhadzise kose yemula kwenyu thama tjibuya nen'hingo webugalimoyo, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />kuyetila kuti zina laHe wedu Yesu likudziwe mumuli, namwi bo mukudziwe muwunli, kuyendidzana nengoni dzeNdzimu wedu nekwaHe Yesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Mbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Nekwehha kwaHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu kose nekubunganyiwa kwedu kuti tihangane naye, tomukumbila makamu, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />kuti musitjimbidze madzinganyidzika mikumbulo, mahangana miholo, kene malobgwa nehana ngentha yedama, kene meya kene lukwalo; kunoti hhuba laHe lakatjiswika, kunoyi kwakabva kutili. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Musibvumile kuti kene yani amutjebele kene nayipi zila. Ngobe hhuba ilelo alitowhoswika, kuhhe kwekuti kwatanga pandukilana, iwhoya nhu usingatobele nlayo atanga azumbunugwa, iye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhu iwhoyu usingatobele nlayo ndiyezwe unodan'wa eyi nkololo wepaladziwa, dzimwe whalo whulukugwi dzoti nhu wejinyo</char></note> unowhopaladziwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Unowholeyana nako kose kunoyi ndzimu kene zwinhu zwinonamatiwa kakale akazwimilidza akaba pehhugwi kwako kose, kuyetila kuti iye anogala muthempeli leNdzimu ezwiti ndiye Ndzimu.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Amutjakumbula kuti titji toseni ndakamubudza zwinhu izwezwi? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Kakale moziba kuti ini tjinowundziba ngwenuwali, kuyetila kuti akozumbunugwa mulubaka gugwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Ngobe masimba esatobela nlayo akasumbikika eehinga ngwenuwali, koga iwhoya unowadziba ngwenuwali unowhoyendilambeli eyeta sayikoku kudzina adusiwa muzila. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Usingatobele nlayo unokotjizumbunugwa, koga He Yesu unowhowumbulaya nefema kwenlomo uwe kakale akawumpaladza ngepenya kwehha kukwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Hha kukwe usingatobele nlayo kuyendidzana nemihingo yaSatane kowhoba kunamasimba ose kakale kuna zwilakidzilo zwemanyepwa nematjenamiso emanyepwa, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />kakale kunatjebela kose kwakayipa kuna ibabo banowhopalala. Banowhopalala ngobe bakalamba da lebeswa kuyetila kuti batjidziwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ngentha yayikoku Ndzimu unobatumila dzibayila kwakasima kudze bagalemoyo manyepwa, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />kuyetila kuti bose ibabo basakagalamoyo kulebeswa koga bakaba nekuhanha mukusalulama bawanikwe nlandu.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imwi Makahaligwa Tjidziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Koga takafanila boka Ndzimu nekwenyu lubaka gose, hama dzinodiwa naHe, Ndzimu wakamuhala kubva kumabambo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dzimwe whalo whulukugwi dzoti mitjelo yekutanga</char></note> kuti mutjidziwe ngeyengemadziwa neMeya nange galamoyo mulebeswa. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Wakamudanila kuna ikoku ngendebo mbuya yatakasumikila, kuyetila kuti muwane gudzo laHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ndizoke hama dzangu, mani makasima kakale mubhatilile pamilenje yatakamudiya, kungaba ngenlomo kene ngewhalo.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />He wedu Yesu Khirisitu tjekukwe, neNdzimu ibo tate bedu, ibo bakatida bakatipa nyaladziwa kusingapele nekugalabgwe kubuya kunobva mungoni, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />bakulumbidze mimoyo yenyu neyisimisa mukuyeta kose kwakanaka nemuleba kose kubuya.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mutitembezelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Tjebupelo, hama dzangu, mutitembezelele, kuyetila kuti dama laHe li andame nekulibilidza kakale likudziwe, sekwalakayetiwa pakati kwenyu, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />nekuti tiwangugwe kubva kubanhu bakayipa kakale bali babi, ngobe akuta kuli kuti bose bana bugalimoyo.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Koga iye He unogalikabgwe, unowhomusimisa, kamutjengeta mumbi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Tina kugalabgwe munaHe nekwenyu, kuti mothama kakale mowhoyendila mbeli muthama zwinhu zose zwatinomulaya.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Kadzene He angatungamidza mimoyo yenyu kuludo gweNdzimu nedzikitidza kwaKhirisitu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhu Wakafanila Hinga Nemaboko Awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Makamu edu, ngwenuwali teemulaya, muzina laHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu, kuti muzwipalalanye nemakamu ana busimbe asingatjile ngetobela nlenje wamakawamutjila kubva kutili. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Ngobe imwi tjekwenyu moziba kuti makafanila titodza tjini, ngobe atizotongoba simbe pataka tinamwi, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />atizotongodla zodliwa zwenhu tisazwilipila, koga takatihinga titukutila siku nesikati tiyetila kuti tisibe ntolo kene kuna yani zwe pakati kwenyu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Takakuthama ikoku kusi ngentha yekuti atina fanilo yepiwa bhatsho, koga takabe tizwithama tjilakidzilo kumuli, tjamungatobela. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ngobe titjinamwi takamupa nlayo iwhoyu, “Hapa nhu esingahake hinga asitongodla.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ngobe towha kuyi pakati kwenyu bayapo banotjila mubusimbe, banoda zwisa muzwinhu zwebanhu besingahake hinga. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Ibabo bakajalo tobatetedza kakale tibakulumbidza munaHe Yesu Khirisitu kuti bahinge bakanyalala, bawane zwingababhatsha mubutjilo gwabo.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Koga imwi makamu edu musinyadziwe nethama tjibuya. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Hapa kuna nhu usingawhilile tjatinoleba mulukwalo igogu, muwunlonge meho, musidlidzane naye kuyetila kuti abhakhwe nehoni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Koga musiwuntole setjita tjenyu, muwuntjemele sehama yenyu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama Ewoneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Kadzene He wekunyalala tjekukwe angamupa kunyalala nezila dzose gose lubaka. He abe namwi mose.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Imi Phawuli ndazwikwalila ngeluboko gwangu buyisa ikoku, nditjo tjilakidzilo mugumwe negumwe lukwalo gwangu, ndiyo zila yandinokwala nayo.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Ngoni dzaHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu ngadzibe nemwi mose.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>